  2. **Clash Avoidance & Timing**: Sui Po (歲破), Year Clash (歲煞), Personal Zodiac clashes,
  Golden Lock hours.


  ### Behavioral Directives

  - Calculate auspicious time windows for major events (marriage, construction, business
  opening).

  - Debate timing exclusions and clashes against imperial calendar rules.'
